  "body": "Opportunities of this scale are increasingly hard to find . \r\nComprising two titles and approximately 1365sqm of elevated coastal land this substantial holding enjoys sea views and offers exciting possibilities for the future \r\nThe existing residence spans both titles while preliminary options have been explored by a local surveyor providing a valuable starting point for purchasers wishing to explore the property  potential subject to council \r\nA compelling proposition for developers ,land bankers or buyers looking beyond the ordinary residential purchase .\r\n\r\nA home with generous proportions, a versatile layout and a prized waterside cul-de-sac setting combine to create a property with exceptional scope and opportunity. This substantial brick home offers space for family living, entertaining and working from home, with a layout that allows everyone room to spread out and enjoy their own space.  Set in an established location that invites exploration of the potential to create several homes, subject to planning and council requirements.\r\n\r\nFor those seeking a substantial family residence, the existing home offers a wealth of accommodation and an impressive range of features.\r\n\r\n* Expansive living areas with a choice of formal and informal spaces\r\n* Seamless flow from the main living areas and master bedroom to a north-west-facing courtyard with in-ground swimming pool\r\n* Distinctive timber panelling has the wow factor throughout the entrance foyer, entertaining areas and hallways\r\n* Five  bedrooms plus  study  on the upper level\r\n* Separate downstairs wing, perfect  for extended family or guests\r\n* Exceptional garaging for up to five vehicles, a dream for the car hobbyist complemented by a workshop and extensive storage\r\n* Half Moon Bay Marina and it's waterfront amenities just minutes away\r\n\r\nThis is a property offering multiple possibilities - enjoy the existing residence, explore future development potential or consider the opportunities presented by the two-title landholding. A substantial home, a generous parcel of land and a sought-after location combine to create an opportunity worthy of serious consideration. \r\n\r\nWe look forward to offering you a private viewing. Contact Ellen Ming on 021 450 856 or ellen.ming@raywhite.com.",
